       On success, ggeettggrroouuppss() returns the number of supplementary group  IDs.
       On error, -1 is returned, and _e_r_r_n_o is set to indicate the error.

       On success, sseettggrroouuppss() returns 0.  On error, -1 is returned, and _e_r_r_n_o
       is set to indicate the error.

